}

# ===========================================================================
# PLAN-163 T5.4 — test/ops seam: run ONLY the settings baseline migration.
# Everything else (tree refresh, agents pin, H8 merge, PROTOCOL pointer,
# purge scan, manifest/state rewrite) is skipped. Honors --dry-run and
